{
  "_why": "The size the Plate claims and nothing in the set had reached: fifteen children, which is the middle of the twelve-to-twenty band the view says it is competent at. Five ranks deep and four wide at the widest, so the router draws corners rather than one straight run. Two fan stems, and only one of them is an offer \u2014 #201 is finished and four children descend from it, #202 is the one thing here that can be started and three more wait on it. Three sidings, each a different mark: a resolved chore, a takeable one nothing waits on, and the spec child. Nothing closes a cycle: `awkward-children.json` owns that reading and a second one would cost this map its own.",
